    {
      "task_id": "ITASK-007",
      "title": "FR-007 Block Before Runner",
      "description": "若 preflight blocked： - 不得调用 `resolve_adapter` 之后的执行路径 - 不得启动任何 runner/native implementation - 必须返回 `implement_branch_guard_blocked` ## 6. Suggested Output Contract ```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"status\": \"blocked\", \"version\": \"v1.1.12\", \"expected_branch\": \"beacon/v1.1.12\", \"current_branch\": \"main\", \"reason_codes\": [ \"git_branch_target_mismatch\", \"git_version_ref_not_satisfied\", \"git_exact_branch_required\" ], \"recommended_command\": \"git switch beacon/v1.1.12\", \"blocked\": true } ``` ## 7. Success Standard 这条线完成时，Beacon 应能稳定做到： 1. 在 `main` 或错误分支上调用 `implement run` 会先被挡住 2. `implement` 失败信息能直接告诉使用者切到哪个分支 3. `workflow` 与 `implement` 不再出现分支规则漂移 4. blocked 和 pass 都会留下 branch preflight evidence",
